id: ops-reverification
title: Choose the cheapest approved checks to re-verify stale claims
description: "Compile a caller-declared dependency and integer-cost map against operational evidence expiry; reuse existing diagnostic execution and core assurance without adding a runner, scheduler or store."
type: Feature
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
